  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Phase-Out Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project addresses all remaining eligible consumption of CFC in KSA and  includes training, technical assistance and investment activities. The Project will allow Saudi Arabia to phase-out its CFCs consumption by January 2010. Because of the very nature of the project, it is essential to adopt a flexible approach in the implementation phase to allow the government to adapt and adjust the proposed activities.</narrative>
  </description>
